# Demo keyring of the docker-compose stack: as secret as the demo passwords.
# One key per line, "<key-id> <base64 of 32 random bytes>". A fresh
# installation starts encrypting with the first line; from then on the key in
# use is the one the key registry records (see Rotation in the README), and
# the other lines are kept for decryption.
demo L3qn57md4OCfjE5fSfu0H6zvuYtxKbE1psqe+9Wnj9U=
